This crate is built on code from the Craft projects by storytold, each licensed under
MIT OR Apache-2.0:

- craft-libs (https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs): `craft-media`, the ISO BMFF (MP4/MOV)
  and Matroska (MKV/WebM) demuxers and muxers, used as a Cargo dependency.
- FilmCraft (https://github.com/storytold/filmcraft): `filmcraft-audio-dsp`, the WSOLA time
  stretcher used for pitch-keeping speed changes, used as a Cargo dependency.

Both are fetched from GitHub at the exact commits pinned in Cargo.toml. `src/lossless.rs`
(the Instant cutter) is original QuickCut code written against the craft-media API.
Other Cargo dependencies (wasm-bindgen, js-sys and their dependencies) keep their own licenses.
